Dialogue: 2,0:01:53.74,0:01:56.57,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(477,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Foul Play
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.41,0:01:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.11,0:01:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Luffy! Luffy! Luffy! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.33,0:02:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.24,0:02:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.31,0:02:08.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.22,0:02:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have terrible news!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.75,0:02:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dinosaur ate Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.03,0:02:12.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in a way?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.47,0:02:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were running through the jungle\Nto get away from the dinosaur,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.75,0:02:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and then suddenly I turned around and\Nshe was gone and must have gotten her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.61,0:02:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got my friend killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.31,0:02:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I live with myself now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.29,0:02:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.19,0:02:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just listen to me for a second, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.21,0:02:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she was there one\Nmoment and gone the next,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.17,0:02:36.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then you can't know for sure\Nwhat happened. Well, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.57,0:02:37.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like it could stop and check.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.85,0:02:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have been eaten, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.91,0:02:41.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was either a dinosaur\Nor some other wild beast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.31,0:02:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What else could it possibly be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.21,0:02:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.85,0:02:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if Baroque Works followed\Nus from Whiskey Peak,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.95,0:02:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would make sense for them\Nto capture Nami and not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.61,0:02:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we may be in great\Ndanger. We should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.69,0:02:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean that Baroque Works\Nis here on the island with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.03,0:02:59.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.19,0:03:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why capture Nami and not me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.73,0:03:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because you haven't gotten in their way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.85,0:03:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most likely you aren't on\Ntheir assassination list.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.33,0:03:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.93,0:03:11.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.35,0:03:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet that booby-trapped alcohol\Nwas meant to get us instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.17,0:03:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.31,0:03:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say about alcohol?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.69,0:03:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Broggy gave Dory some of your alcohol\Nthat must have been tampered with,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.11,0:03:25.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because when Dory drank\Nthe barrels, they exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.11,0:03:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.13,0:03:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They actually exploded inside the guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.65,0:03:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, he was injured that badly\Nand he still ran off to go fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.01,0:03:37.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tried to stop him and that's\Nhow I ended up like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.87,0:03:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.65,0:03:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two have been fighting as hard\Nas they can for a hundred years,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.77,0:03:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they always ended in a draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.53,0:03:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, their duels are fought with the\Nmost honor and pride in the whole world!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.47,0:03:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:04:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way they can settle\Nit once and for all like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.93,0:04:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.13,0:04:17.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he keeps fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.59,0:04:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.50,0:04:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He certainly is stubborn,\Nthat Dory the Blue Ogre.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.33,0:04:27.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, well, I should lend some assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.33,0:04:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A whole century.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.07,0:04:48.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has been a long and\Ndifficult battle indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.85,0:05:31.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I now know that this was a judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.55,0:05:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A judgment from Elbath, the god of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.79,0:05:36.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't have the god's protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.15,0:05:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.97,0:05:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Luffy! Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.95,0:05:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.83,0:05:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who did that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.41,0:06:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr. Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.79,0:06:08.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.11,0:06:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some pathetic animal yelping\Nhelplessly in the jungle. Amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.61,0:06:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, these fights,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,73, 467 duels,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.25,0:06:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,73, 466 draws,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.45,0:06:42.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and one win
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.19,0:06:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.23,0:07:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.14,0:07:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see tears of joy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.06,0:07:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt that happiness will last long!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.61,0:07:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for now I offer\Nyou my congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.51,0:07:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you say happiness?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.17,0:07:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.29,0:07:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you little man? I am Mr. Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.81,0:07:18.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a code name of course which\Nis necessary in my line of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.21,0:07:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am an artist of sorts\Nand this is my assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.93,0:07:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the best artists\Nrequire assistance you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.49,0:07:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her name
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.03,0:07:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is Miss Goldenweed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.95,0:07:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I tell you all this because I've already\Ncaught you in one of my artworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.19,0:07:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.10,0:07:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you done to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.83,0:07:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.21,0:07:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what we're dealing with here,\Nbut I'm gonna take care of them myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.35,0:07:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll come too, Usopp. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.31,0:07:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having you along with\Nme will be reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.65,0:07:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.31,0:07:56.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys again!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.19,0:08:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can have him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.89,0:08:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.77,0:08:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.89,0:08:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.59,0:08:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, who are these guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.41,0:08:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bullies from the last island!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.57,0:08:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kado never did anything to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.43,0:08:20.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you have to do this to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.27,0:08:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.18,0:08:24.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We had no need to retaliate\Nagainst your ugly bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.11,0:08:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we needed to get our hands on that\Nlittle straw-haired friend of yours, you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.37,0:08:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The plan was simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.93,0:08:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wanted to lure you both\Ninto the jungle by having
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.29,0:08:36.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your dear birdie here\Nsquawk pitifully for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.61,0:08:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the idiot refused to cooperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.89,0:08:42.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, then! Call for your own owner!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.39,0:08:47.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give us a really loud squawk\Nand we might even let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.85,0:08:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, then we'll make you squawk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.39,0:08:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just call for the princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.49,0:09:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call for help now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.09,0:09:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it, bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.45,0:09:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Call out to your beloved\Nprincess, and this will all end!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.97,0:09:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just open your mouth, you damn creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.01,0:09:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then we realized\Nthat little Straw Hat was
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.51,0:09:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,already neatly trapped\Nhere just waiting for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.99,0:09:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In which case, we didn't\Nneed that thing anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.43,0:09:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karoo?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.27,0:09:27.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a dumb bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.55,0:09:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.05,0:09:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And were you the ones who planted\Na bomb to injure the giant Dory?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.27,0:09:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.71,0:09:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this new guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.99,0:09:40.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he on the list?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.17,0:09:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, but he's clearly a friend of theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.49,0:09:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just get rid of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.99,0:09:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you interfere\Nwith a proud warrior duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.97,0:09:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.21,0:09:50.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kick your asses!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.53,0:09:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about I get rid of you instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.01,0:09:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just so cute when\Nyou find Miss Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.73,0:10:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's more, she really thinks she\Nstands a chance against agent like us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.61,0:10:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taste my peacock slasher!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.71,0:10:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.09,0:10:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exploding Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.79,0:10:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.81,0:10:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.05,0:10:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nose fence and cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.33,0:10:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you get burned? Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.35,0:10:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,10,000 kilograms? Press!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.87,0:10:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.49,0:10:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.35,0:10:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to get so\Nupset right now, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.19,0:10:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We aren't planning to kill you yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.69,0:10:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We only came here to abduct you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.59,0:10:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those were Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.73,0:10:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three's explicit orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.99,0:10:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Three?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.35,0:11:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Wax Wax Fruit Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.45,0:11:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's here on the island\Nwith us! That's right. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.37,0:11:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three the Candleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.89,0:11:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His body creates wax which he\Ncan then control as he likes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.23,0:11:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.11,0:11:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.93,0:11:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.95,0:11:23.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it's lost on someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.55,0:11:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on is that I'm creating\Na work of art with your assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.21,0:11:36.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand still like a good little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.65,0:11:38.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you actually think\Nthat someone like you could
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.03,0:11:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,escape from an organization\Nlike Baroque Works?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.43,0:11:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.53,0:11:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your friend over there has a big bounty on
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.71,0:11:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,his head and look at what happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.69,0:11:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.60,0:11:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider this our thank you for\Nwhat happened at Whiskey Peak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.33,0:12:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should learn to mind your own business,\Nyou pathetic group of wannabe pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.93,0:12:02.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would be quite\Nbeneficial to your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.75,0:12:04.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, we have your swordsman friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.95,0:12:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we've captured the other girl that\Nyou brought along with you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.73,0:12:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you caught Zoro? Damn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.09,0:12:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, you're in\Nmore trouble than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.51,0:12:17.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see how big you talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.89,0:12:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After one of my kicky bombs blows\Nup their little face of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.95,0:12:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try whatever tricks you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.39,0:12:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.43,0:12:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This should be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.93,0:12:34.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mufi, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.61,0:12:54.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You weak little fool. Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.89,0:12:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Please! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.89,0:12:59.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Miss Valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.55,0:13:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.89,0:13:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cut out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.31,0:13:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.51,0:13:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Struggling is pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.25,0:13:30.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once my candle jacket\Nsolidifies around you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.65,0:13:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll become as hard as iron and\Nit's impossible to break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.37,0:13:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no denying that\Nyou giants are very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.23,0:13:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But once you've been captured, that\Nstrength doesn't do you any good at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.85,0:13:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.76,0:13:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that I had to do was use my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.71,0:13:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There would be no sense in trying\Nto defeat you in a physical fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.47,0:13:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were so busy enjoying your great win.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.19,0:13:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The capturing you is easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.39,0:13:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't glare at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.19,0:13:58.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's positively terrifying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.87,0:14:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be celebrating, shouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.33,0:14:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At long last, your battle with Dory\Nthe Blue Ogre has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.51,0:14:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fought on this island for a\Nhundred years for your precious pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.11,0:14:13.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't such a long-lasting battle\Nmake victory all the more sweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.75,0:14:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, really, it's an accomplishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.37,0:14:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it required a little outside help.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.23,0:14:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, give me a little smile. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.33,0:14:24.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would you know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.27,0:14:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, the real victor\Nin all of this is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.91,0:14:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bounties placed on your heads\Nlong ago remain in place to this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.99,0:14:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today you're worth 200 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.05,0:14:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite a handsome son.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.11,0:14:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bounties?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.02,0:14:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big bounties.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.23,0:14:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel as if I've uncovered\Na long-lost treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.63,0:14:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's what you're\Nafter, huh? Hmm? Mr. 3!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.55,0:14:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,three here's the girl\Nalabaster's sneaky spy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.09,0:14:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's about time I was\Npositively sick of waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.75,0:15:01.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're full of nothing but dirty tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.61,0:15:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.85,0:15:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Putting a bomb in Dory's\Nalcohol was low even for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.09,0:15:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the barrels!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.63,0:15:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did something to the\NThe drinks that I gave Dory?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.87,0:15:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dory, how was your drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.77,0:15:18.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit the spot, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.73,0:15:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it tasted almost godly, in fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.73,0:15:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that must be what Dory meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.45,0:15:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, you're an annoying little girl,\NPrincess, giving away our secrets like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.67,0:15:31.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.11,0:15:35.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't anything he can\Ndo about it now, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.91,0:15:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,CANDLE!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.31,0:15:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.23,0:15:52.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five, bring the swordsman\Nand the other girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.03,0:15:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.13,0:16:01.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,GIANT CANDLE!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.85,0:16:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.83,0:16:33.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here are the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.39,0:16:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.39,0:16:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiots like these should have\Nbeen a lot easier for me to catch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.35,0:16:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should have caught them the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.01,0:16:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.92,0:16:50.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that thing? Nothing good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.71,0:16:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.29,0:16:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, Phoebe, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.39,0:16:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were with Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.71,0:16:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was, but now...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.89,0:17:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're wondering about the straw\Nhat, I saw to that little runt myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.81,0:17:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he didn't put up\Nmuch of a fight, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.99,0:17:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.81,0:17:28.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome, one and all, to my\Nfamous candle service set!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.71,0:17:35.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess this is what it feels like, to\Nbe a candle stuck on a birthday cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.97,0:17:38.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, what's that spinning up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.45,0:17:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't move. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.75,0:17:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not surprising to me that\Nthey don't want us moving around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.93,0:17:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what capture means.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.77,0:17:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, that stuff's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.25,0:17:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I can't put much strength\Nbehind my swing from this angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.59,0:17:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.85,0:18:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do hope you enjoy my candle service.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.19,0:18:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may have noticed the wax\Nflakes that are falling from above.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.21,0:18:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll eventually be covered\Nand turned into wax figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.47,0:18:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll become perfectly lifelike\Nstatues for my collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.01,0:18:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something that even I\Ncouldn't achieve on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.97,0:18:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will literally capture your spirits\Nand encase them forever in wax shells.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.73,0:18:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will be a true masterpiece.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.21,0:18:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will die for my art.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.75,0:18:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think so, you freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.55,0:18:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no interest in dying for\Nwhatever it is you consider art!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.27,0:18:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.18,0:18:36.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you laying there\Ndoing nothing when you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.23,0:18:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could be beating the crap\Nout of this candle guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.99,0:18:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he is going to make one huge statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.83,0:18:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can try to convince him, but\Nyour efforts will be useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.19,0:18:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a little blue at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.97,0:18:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.88,0:18:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he just realized how\Nunfairly he won his last
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.69,0:18:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fight and he's lost\Nthe heart to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.89,0:18:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He killed his dear friend Dory with\Nwhom he had fought for 100 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.89,0:18:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dory was injured, but he didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.87,0:19:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just imagine how much pain\NDory must have been in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.39,0:19:03.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.31,0:19:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did shed a few tears, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.31,0:19:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you were crying for your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.91,0:19:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's no use.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.35,0:19:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no one doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.79,0:19:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dead, and it's all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.37,0:19:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should have seen it. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.41,0:19:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew something strange was going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.99,0:19:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the moment we first began to\Nfight, I knew Dory was hiding something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.59,0:19:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I couldn't tell what it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.57,0:19:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.48,0:19:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You say that you knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.21,0:19:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.63,0:19:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you knew something was wrong,\Nwhy didn't you stop the fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.65,0:19:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you give him a chance to rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.89,0:19:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't see one tread of pity in\Nthe way you ruthlessly cut him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.59,0:19:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know nothing about honorable duels.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.19,0:20:02.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone like you could\Nnever understand my tears!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.21,0:20:05.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you know about the way of Elbath?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.49,0:20:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think that I would shame a warrior?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.13,0:20:12.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who hid the fact that he was weakened\Nso that he could continue to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.15,0:20:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a truly great\Nwarrior would go to such
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.99,0:20:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lengths and such a man\Nisn't interested in pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.05,0:20:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I know what really happened,\Nand I must do something about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.37,0:20:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to finish this\Nwith my own two hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.97,0:20:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the least I can do for Dory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.15,0:20:44.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was a great warrior and my dear friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.99,0:20:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brogy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.79,0:21:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This chatterin' was gettin' on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.61,0:21:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp. Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.59,0:21:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have to pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.17,0:21:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.08,0:21:16.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those jerks have to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.77,0:21:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't...take this either!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.73,0:21:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, then it's settled!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.23,0:21:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go beat them senseless!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.89,0:21:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brogy!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.77,0:21:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.77,0:21:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems that I miscalculated.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.31,0:21:49.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot how freakishly strong\Nthese dumb giants can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.67,0:21:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like you're going to\Nrequire more complete restraint.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.47,0:21:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Works, works!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.57,0:21:58.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Handcuffs!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.31,0:22:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still going!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.27,0:22:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now for the finishing touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.67,0:22:12.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.01,0:22:24.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be tough for you\Nto move now, won't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.21,0:22:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are despicable!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.59,0:22:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's get these candles going faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.11,0:22:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to turn these people into\Nbeautiful, artistic wax figures!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.13,0:22:50.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My chest is starting to hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.39,0:22:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wax is starting to get into our lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.39,0:22:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, he's gonna turn\Nus into wax from the inside out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.01,0:22:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.92,0:23:01.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make it look like you're in\Nas much pain as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.23,0:23:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.63,0:23:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Expressions of agony are what\NI seek to achieve in my art.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.41,0:23:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The finished product\Nwill be simply splendid!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.85,0:23:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must die filled with terror!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.37,0:23:14.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what you call art, you\Ncreaky, weird-haired freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.79,0:23:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys are gonna regret this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.79,0:23:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for what you did to Brook
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.67,0:23:20.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Dory and for what\Nyou're trying to do to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.75,0:23:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can yell and scream all\Nyou want to, little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.67,0:23:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can help you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.19,0:23:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A century.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.71,0:23:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For 100 years, Dory and I dueled day\Nin and day out, fighting endlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.31,0:23:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We battled for our pride, as is\Nthe way of the warriors of Elbaph!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.69,0:23:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We fought with honor and with strength,\Nand still we are subjected to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.09,0:23:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why has this happened to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.49,0:24:04.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must we be forced to meet\Nour end in such a way?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.81,0:24:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must we?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.41,0:24:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It isn't fair for a warrior to\Ndie such a dishonorable death!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.09,0:24:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can I not die in battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.95,0:24:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold that look.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.39,0:24:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.53,0:24:21.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such grief, such sorrow, and\Njust the right amount of anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.91,0:24:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How marvelous.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.95,0:24:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Elbaph, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.67,0:24:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.03,0:24:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hands won't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.17,0:24:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't we do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.09,0:24:32.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.17,0:24:34.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My body's already beginning to turn stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.91,0:24:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.21,0:24:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.31,0:24:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.33,0:24:42.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can still move, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.47,0:24:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good. So can I.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.71,0:24:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I say we take them down together.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.97,0:24:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.21,0:24:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.27,0:24:54.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.79,0:24:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you? Yeah. Quit messing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.07,0:24:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going to cut your own legs off.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.63,0:24:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not messing around at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.01,0:25:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the only way to get\Nus out of this situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.71,0:25:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you in or out?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.73,0:25:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you insane? No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.35,0:25:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you get down from here,\Nyou won't get far without legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.49,0:25:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way to know\Nfor sure until we try.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.51,0:25:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So are you saying you'd\Nrather just sit here and die?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.35,0:25:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should we make it easy\Nfor those guys to kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.71,0:25:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dying quietly without a struggle\Ndoesn't make you any less dead, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.33,0:25:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The girl was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.41,0:25:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.83,0:25:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's bluffing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.79,0:25:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he would do\Nsomething as crazy as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.05,0:25:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just trying to act tough\Nso his friends will feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.92,0:25:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That runt's got spirit.\NI'll give him that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.09,0:25:37.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's doing better than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.01,0:25:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had actually begun to\Nlose the will to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.15,0:25:42.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.51,0:25:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's cut them to pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.31,0:25:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not serious about this, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.63,0:25:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you planning on\Nfighting them afterward?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.03,0:25:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows? But...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.27,0:25:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I plan to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.51,0:25:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.11,0:25:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're completely nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.39,0:26:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of man is he, and why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.31,0:26:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, I've seen this\Nlook somewhere before...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.45,0:26:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi, sometimes it takes\Nmore strength to live than to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.25,0:26:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'll fight with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.75,0:26:14.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.66,0:26:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.97,0:26:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.41,0:26:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be foolish. What did\Nyou want to accomplish?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.25,0:26:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I get back, I'm\Ngoing to kick your ass in!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.97,0:26:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get him, Usopp! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.41,0:26:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.79,0:26:48.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loopy! Usopp! Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.77,0:26:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're here, Brogy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.15,0:26:52.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we'll pick\Nup where you left off.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.89,0:26:53.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.97,0:26:55.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beat them beyond recognition.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.69,0:26:58.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show them expressions of pain\Nand agony they won't soon forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.93,0:26:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.39,0:27:02.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys messed up the best duel ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.53,0:27:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're in some serious trouble\Nand they're gonna answer to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.53,0:27:08.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're the one with the\Nhighest bounty in the East Blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.51,0:27:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, how low marine standards have fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.71,0:27:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost tragic, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.49,0:27:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.25,0:27:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.19,0:27:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude, it's on fire! Hush, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.71,0:27:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, he has weird hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.97,0:27:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, could you break this pillar?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.41,0:27:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're about to turn into wax figures!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.01,0:27:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, are you guys in trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.73,0:27:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, no trouble at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.31,0:27:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Zoro, your leg!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.15,0:27:32.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I made it about\Nhalfway through, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.35,0:27:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how exactly is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.59,0:27:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No trouble at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.35,0:27:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Luffy, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.19,0:27:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you go ahead and take\Ncare of this pillar for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.89,0:27:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I've done enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.97,0:27:42.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.05,0:27:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.96,0:27:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.65,0:27:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what it\Nis, but let's break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.95,0:27:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.37,0:27:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, the brave warrior of\Nthe sea, is ready to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.27,0:27:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.41,0:28:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're dying here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.53,0:28:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tries to be fast from leaving home.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.31,0:28:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The factor behind our\Nback just keeps us strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.57,0:28:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too bad, because\Nwe're still selling for?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.69,0:28:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so fun for ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.37,0:28:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave us alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.35,0:28:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may be for this\Nchasing impossible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.23,0:28:42.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I just gotta try.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.69,0:28:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crazier the dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.29,0:28:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more ambition I'm gonna need.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.33,0:28:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may be for this driving home.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.69,0:28:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I know that I've just gotta fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.09,0:29:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Far through the sea,\Nthe great of paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.13,0:29:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've gotta fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.19,0:29:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up. Just keep on trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.43,0:29:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you'll see that you're closer to?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.07,0:29:10.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The horizon of your dreams.

